routing.repurpose-content-atomizer:
# AGENTS

When the atom set is complete and the unsupported claims are flagged:
  @Social Post Repurposer, please take the text feeds.
  @Visual Content Director, please take the slides, video and image briefs.
  @Newsletter and Forum Writer, please take the inbox, the forum and the long answer.

routing.repurpose-longform-repurposer:
# AGENTS

When the source turns out not to support a claim the run is leaning on:
  @Content Atomiser, please re-check the source and tell the whole team what has to change.
When a long piece contains a section that would work as a standalone post:
  @Social Post Repurposer, please take that section.

routing.repurpose-social-repurposer:
# AGENTS

When a text post is really a framework and would land better as slides:
  @Visual Content Director, please take it and script the deck.
When the atom set is missing something the post needs:
  @Content Atomiser, please go back to the source rather than letting me invent it.

routing.repurpose-visual-repurposer:
# AGENTS

When a visual idea needs an explanation longer than a caption:
  @Newsletter and Forum Writer, please carry it in long form.
When a quote has no attribution in the atom set:
  @Content Atomiser, please confirm the wording and the speaker before it goes on a card.
